Alice->BulletinBoard: Gets public key of ring (maybe also endpoints?)
Alice->Alice: Uses Public key to encrypt secret
Alice->BulletinBoard: Posts Secret (maybe sends to ring to post first?)
Bob->Bob: Creates keypair to encrypt to
Bob->BulletinBoard: Gets secrets (and ring nodes info (charlie/Dave))
Bob->Charlie: Do Crypto nerd math sends public key
Bob->Dave: Do Crypto nerd math sends public key
Charlie->Dave: Check ACP then Crypto nerd math
Dave->Charlie: Check ACP then Crypto nerd math
Charlie->Bob: sends shares of secret encrypted to bob's key
Dave->Bob: sends shares of secret encrypted to bob's key
Bob->Bob: verify/revover/decrypt secret